WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.985
Window averages let us show detail and context
together In this example

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:10.353
every employee row remains while additional columns
show the average salary for

00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:16.028
that employee's department and the average salary
for the entire company Run

00:00:16.054 --> 00:00:20.294
the query and look at two employees from the same
department Their

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.386
department-average value should be the same because
the window partition is the

00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:30.026
same while their individual salaries remain
different Then compare

00:00:30.052 --> 00:00:35.839
those department averages with the overall company
average This kind of result

00:00:35.865 --> 00:00:39.379
is useful when you want to evaluate each individual
row relative to

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:42.879
a peer group or to the entire dataset without losing
the original

00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:43.458
detail
